// "[Player] mills N cards" [CR#701.17a]: that player, the actor, puts that
// many cards from the top of their library into their graveyard. Lean `mill`. The clamp to
// library size [CR#701.17b] is the rules', not the clause's.
KeywordAction(
    name: "mill",
    params: [Amount],
    spelling: "mill",
    grammar: Verb(
        bare: "mill",
        frame_set: Transitive,
    ),
    body: move(librarySlice(Top, Param(0), actor), library, graveyard),
)
